  "path": "/books/big-ballas-guide/",
  "title": "Big Ballas Guide",
  "text": "Big Ballas Guide by Lee Felican Jr. — Making money with AI, minus the course-selling.\nAbout: There is an enormous amount of content about making money with AI and most of it is selling the content. Big Ballas Guide is the practical version: where the real opportunities are, what they require, and which of the popular ideas do not survive contact with a paying customer. Written from the position of someone building and selling AI systems to real businesses, which is a different vantage point from someone selling a course about it.\nFor you if: You want to build something with AI that people pay for. You have been through the free content and want substance. You would rather know what fails before you spend months on it. You are weighing several AI business ideas and need a way to judge them."
