  "text": "The AI Business Starter Pack is $2,500 one-time and bundles Private AI, the Chat AI Assistant and Voice AI, all generated from one shared source of business knowledge. Any one of the three alone is $999 one-time.\nMonthly hosting plans (one is required, first month charged at purchase): Essentials $50/month: 25 GB storage, 2,000 website-assistant replies, 100 Voice AI minutes, and $10 of Private AI processing; Growth $100/month: 75 GB storage, 6,000 website-assistant replies, 300 Voice AI minutes, and $25 of Private AI processing; Scale $200/month: 200 GB storage, 20,000 website-assistant replies, 800 Voice AI minutes, and $60 of Private AI processing.\nAdd-ons: extra custom model $299 one-time, extra automation $199 one-time, image generation $40/month, video generation $90/month. One-time add-ons bill with the purchase; monthly add-ons join the hosting plan. No overage charges.\nPer-engine token pricing for Private AI processing: /starter-pack/ai-engines/. Checkout: /checkout/.\nQ: What does monthly hosting cover? A: Every plan includes hosting, maintenance, usage tracking, and advance limit warnings. Essentials is $50/month, Growth is $100/month, and Scale is $200/month. Each step adds more storage, website-assistant replies, Voice AI minutes, and Private AI processing. Your selected plan appears in Stripe checkout: its first month is charged today with your product purchase, then hosting renews monthly until canceled. Q: What happens if I reach a monthly limit? A: Only the feature that reached its limit pauses. Your other products and stored data stay available. You can wait for the next monthly reset or choose a larger fixed plan in your Stripe billing portal. There are no surprise per-message, per-minute, or storage overage charges from Felican AI. Q: What if I need more models, automations, or images and video? A: Those are add-ons. An extra custom model is $299 one-time, an extra automation is $199 one-time, image generation is $40/month, and video generation is $90/month. One-time add-ons are charged with your purchase; monthly ones join your hosting plan. You can add any of them later — nothing has to be decided today. Q: Do I really own it? A: Yes. The AI is trained on your business, branded as your business, and the knowledge base is yours. Your information isn't used to train a public model. Q: Do I need to be technical? A: No. You paste your website link, drop in any documents you want it to know, and it builds itself. The website assistant is a single line of code your web person can paste in a minute — and if you don't have a web person, we'll walk you through it. Q: What if I only want one of them? A: Buy one for $999. You can add the others later — they'll plug into the same knowledge base you already built. Q: What if my business changes? A: Add new information any time. Update your hours or your prices once and every product you own updates with it."
